### Document status

This file is a structural stub. The bracketed `[NITDA legal: …]` markers
flag every place where the agency's legal office must confirm content
before a public release. The scaffolding (sections, ordering, the
trademark separation, the brand carve-out) is design-system work and is
ready as-is. The legal text is not the system's to invent.

Until those markers are resolved, this directory should be treated as
internal-only and distribution should be limited to teams under direct
NITDA programme oversight.
